			"notes": "## ✨ Colored Alphabet Blocks v2.0.0\n\n## ⚠️ A major overhaul bringing ⚠️\n**Please Backup your world before update**\n\n- **🔄 Automatic Save & Legacy Migration**:\n  - Backward compatibility with worlds saved under 1.0.0 (`alphabet_block:*` -> `colored_alphabet_blocks:*`) across Fabric, Forge, and NeoForge.\n- **🚀 Multi-Loader & Multi-Version Support**:\n  - **Minecraft 26.3**: Fabric, Forge, NeoForge (✨New Support)\n  - **Minecraft 26.2**: Fabric, Forge, NeoForge (✨New Support)\n  - **Minecraft 1.21.11**: Fabric, Forge, NeoForge\n  - **Minecraft 1.21.1**: Fabric, Forge, NeoForge\n- **⚡ JPMS & Runtime Fixes**: Resolved classpath and runtime resolution issues across all client loaders.\n- **🎨 Modern Rendering & Dye Support**: Native Java 25 & Mojang 26.x DataComponents / BlockTintSource integration."
